{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"y":0.082791864999552045,"w":0.501593271891276,"c":1,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.069581807358352801,"h":0.039387051115897576},{"t":"Additional sample Writing answers","x":0.15115529758600996,"w":0.28988728841145828,"h":0.020020559198017041,"c":1,"y":0.15273077192005979},{"h":0.013120336324626503,"c":1,"w":0.15145631154378253,"t":"in Resource Bank","x":0.15145631015043881,"y":0.17441860455964642},{"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 1","w":0.35533981323242186,"h":0.021859378755278325,"y":0.22523364463230677,"c":1,"x":0.069902908826964372},{"h":0.01969554817936503,"y":0.25708814469287677,"x":0.069847455831270791,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","c":1,"w":0.691356455485026},{"c":1,"y":0.28379719009055948,"x":0.067908106523390382,"t":"The line graph illustrates the proportion of urban citizens in Philippines, Malaysia, Thailand and","w":0.80011489868164054,"h":0.021642258308386841},{"y":0.30654205601645579,"w":0.68932037353515618,"t":"Indonesia between 1970 and 2020, with the expected population in 2030 and 2040.","x":0.067961172358635483,"c":1,"h":0.020560747663551426},{"t":"Overall, it can be easily seen that all four countries has a dramatic rise in population, starting at","h":0.021676412326895877,"c":1,"y":0.33320030002354017,"x":0.06983370524543242,"w":0.80594401041666663},{"w":0.59611648559570307,"h":0.020378722431503737,"t":"the lowest point in 1970 and being projected to reach the peak in 2040.","c":1,"x":0.067961174583216363,"y":0.35607476646205338},{"h":0.020348838259497959,"c":1,"y":0.38372092970484484,"w":0.7825242614746093,"t":"Malaysia and Indonesia saw a slightly rise in population, respectively from 30 to about 45 and","x":0.069902917711793106},{"y":0.40552325608798223,"w":0.83495147705078132,"x":0.067961154587653616,"c":1,"h":0.0188953482844747,"t":"around 12 to over 20 percent from 1970 to 1990. After that, both countries has climbed rapidly until"},{"t":"now before being predicted to continue increasing for the next 20 years.","x":0.067961171091583686,"h":0.020348838259497959,"y":0.42732558086523897,"c":1,"w":0.60776697794596346},{"h":0.020560747663551426,"y":0.4548286608757024,"c":1,"t":"After almost remaining in the 70s, Philippines percentage increased dramatically to reach about","x":0.069902904620528256,"w":0.79805826822916659},{"c":1,"y":0.47663551418147487,"t":"47 percent on 1990 and dropped to 40% in 2010. Then, this country faced slightly rise in 2020.","x":0.06796115875823025,"w":0.79223302205403656,"h":0.020560747663551426},{"y":0.49844236748812332,"w":0.82330098470052093,"t":"Meanwhile, Thailand reached approximate 30% in 1990 and saw not much changes until 2020. Both","x":0.069902905617540895,"c":1,"h":0.020560747663551426},{"c":1,"h":0.022303779102931576,"w":0.60599731445312499,"t":"two countries are projected to increase in population in 2030 and 2040.","x":0.067874731563189239,"y":0.51859617364397204},{"y":0.55077881603961354,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1,"x":0.069902912967183581,"w":0.31262135823567705},{"h":0.017461783863673697,"t":"This response covers the requirements of the task. There is an overview in the","x":0.11650485575171464,"y":0.57848837198013203,"c":1,"w":0.73786407470703119},{"x":0.11645319199385493,"c":1,"y":0.59588701297338509,"t":"second paragraph and key features are presented for each country, with main","h":0.021806546980718156,"w":0.73021158854166668},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"y":0.61619937714029105,"w":0.16116504669189452,"c":1,"t":"trends identified.","x":0.11456310765217914},{"w":0.78846766153971359,"c":1,"x":0.11450559886318161,"y":0.63735740123939988,"t":"Ideas are grouped together with a clear overall progression: countries with a similar","h":0.019511998256790286},{"c":1,"y":0.65697674407296447,"x":0.11456310028144941,"h":0.017478084861303755,"t":"trend are presented in the same paragraph, first Malaysia and Indonesia, then","w":0.73592234293619785},{"h":0.017585851247436945,"c":1,"x":0.11456311360963677,"w":0.77669901529947916,"t":"Thailand and the Philippines. There is some effective use of linkers [Overall | After","y":0.67587209291045536},{"w":0.77864079793294272,"x":0.11650484365161806,"y":0.69470405003543445,"c":1,"h":0.017505252398434479,"t":"that | Meanwhile] and other cohesive devices [respectively | this country], but a few"},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371899566256,"w":0.23689320882161458,"t":"errors remain [Both two].","x":0.11650485188137945,"y":0.7136627907817138},{"c":1,"t":"Vocabulary includes a range, with some less common examples [proportion |","w":0.72427185058593746,"y":0.73546511616606636,"x":0.11456310373178165,"h":0.017494385264744228},{"t":"expected population | dramatic rise | projected to reach the peak]. There are some","x":0.11650484541801499,"h":0.017596718381127086,"c":1,"y":0.75420560730615149,"w":0.77281555175781247},{"y":0.77320872253162987,"x":0.11650486465174491,"w":0.76504852294921866,"c":1,"h":0.017488951994994006,"t":"errors [slightly \/ slight | almost remaining | approximate \/ approximately], which do"},{"w":0.26407765706380204,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"t":"not impede communication.","y":0.79215116287995502,"x":0.11650486068686315},{"y":0.81395348864556227,"c":1,"w":0.7417475891113281,"x":0.114563098552919,"h":0.018895348284474811,"t":"The mix of grammatical structures is good, with some complex sentence forms"},{"w":0.78058252970377606,"t":"[being predicted to continue increasing for the next 20 years]. Some errors remain,","x":0.11456311310927675,"y":0.83139534924613023,"c":1,"h":0.020348835882739502},{"h":0.01747265040317425,"c":1,"t":"but they rarely reduce communication.","x":0.11650485958071016,"y":0.85171339540678759,"w":0.3631067911783854},{"x":0.11456310645056969,"w":0.74368932088216144,"h":0.017523364485981241,"c":1,"y":0.87499999988712751,"t":"To improve the Band Score for this response, there could be more detail on the"},{"x":0.11448893010626827,"t":"similarity of the trends on the graph, more detail on data from 1990 onwards and","c":1,"w":0.75745839436848972,"y":0.89129593491556691,"h":0.022724439199097057},{"w":0.76504852294921877,"t":"fewer errors in spelling and grammar. However, this is a good response that does","x":0.11456311706443216,"h":0.019003115264797588,"y":0.91277258586072618,"c":1},{"t":"address the requirements of the task.","x":0.1144118987620773,"h":0.01988124372060418,"w":0.35558311462402348,"c":1,"y":0.93030201740266338},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"w":0.034951454798380577,"y":0.95203488387958535,"t":"127","x":0.86796116596003303}]}